 "captions": [
  {
   "t0": 0.525,
   "t1": 3.52,
   "text": "Tonight, the Moon starts coming closer.",
   "line": "L1",
   "spoken": "Tonight, the Moon starts coming closer."
  },
  {
   "t0": 3.625,
   "t1": 5.92,
   "text": "And it never stops.",
   "line": "L1",
   "spoken": "And it never stops."
  },
  {
   "t0": 6.72,
   "t1": 14.525,
   "text": "Right now it's about 384,000 km away, drifting off 3.8 cm a year.",
   "line": "L2",
   "spoken": "Right now it's about three hundred eighty-four thousand kilometers away, drifting off three point eight centimeters a year."
  },
  {
   "t0": 14.545,
   "t1": 16.45,
   "text": "Tonight, it reverses.",
   "line": "L2",
   "spoken": "Tonight, it reverses."
  },
  {
   "t0": 16.56,
   "t1": 19.65,
   "text": "A thought experiment, built from real physics.",
   "line": "L2",
   "spoken": "A thought experiment, built from real physics."
  },
  {
   "t0": 20.27,
   "t1": 21.49,
   "text": "Watch the number.",
   "line": "L3",
   "spoken": "Watch the number."
  },
  {
   "t0": 21.51,
   "t1": 23.52,
   "text": "It only goes down.",
   "line": "L3",
   "spoken": "It only goes down."
  },
  {
   "t0": 30.03,
   "t1": 32.265,
   "text": "288,000.",
   "line": "L4",
   "spoken": "Two hundred eighty-eight thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 32.285,
   "t1": 34.49,
   "text": "A third wider.",
   "line": "L4",
   "spoken": "A third wider."
  },
  {
   "t0": 37.63,
   "t1": 41.09,
   "text": "And the sea already feels it: more than twice the tidal pull.",
   "line": "L4",
   "spoken": "And the sea already feels it: more than twice the tidal pull."
  },
  {
   "t0": 45.09,
   "t1": 49.82,
   "text": "Halve the distance, and the water starts to climb.",
   "line": "L5",
   "spoken": "Halve the distance, and the water starts to climb."
  },
  {
   "t0": 56.34,
   "t1": 58.21,
   "text": "Half the distance.",
   "line": "L6",
   "spoken": "Half the distance."
  },
  {
   "t0": 58.23,
   "t1": 60.15,
   "text": "Twice as wide.",
   "line": "L6",
   "spoken": "Twice as wide."
  },
  {
   "t0": 60.26,
   "t1": 61.97,
   "text": "8× the tidal pull.",
   "line": "L6",
   "spoken": "Eight times the tidal pull."
  },
  {
   "t0": 73.785,
   "t1": 74.8,
   "text": "Not a measured height.",
   "line": "L7",
   "spoken": "Not a measured height."
  },
  {
   "t0": 79.885,
   "t1": 85.25,
   "text": "Just the idea: the whole ocean, lifted from above.",
   "line": "L7",
   "spoken": "Just the idea: the whole ocean, lifted from above."
  },
  {
   "t0": 91.76,
   "t1": 94.96,
   "text": "And the night is about to change.",
   "line": "L8",
   "spoken": "And the night is about to change."
  },
  {
   "t0": 103.25,
   "t1": 104.91,
   "text": "150,000.",
   "line": "L9",
   "spoken": "One hundred fifty thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 104.93,
   "t1": 107.45,
   "text": "6.5× the moonlight.",
   "line": "L9",
   "spoken": "Six and a half times the moonlight."
  },
  {
   "t0": 114.73,
   "t1": 118.02,
   "text": "Your shadow is sharp on the sand.",
   "line": "L9",
   "spoken": "Your shadow is sharp on the sand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 124.6,
   "t1": 126.395,
   "text": "And it's faster.",
   "line": "L10",
   "spoken": "And it's faster."
  },
  {
   "t0": 130.56,
   "t1": 134.29,
   "text": "One lap takes about 7 days, not 27.",
   "line": "L10",
   "spoken": "One lap takes about seven days, not twenty-seven."
  },
  {
   "t0": 143.065,
   "t1": 144.77,
   "text": "It's bigger than the Sun now.",
   "line": "L11",
   "spoken": "It's bigger than the Sun now."
  },
  {
   "t0": 150.56,
   "t1": 152.94,
   "text": "So what happens when they line up?",
   "line": "L11",
   "spoken": "So what happens when they line up?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 160.57,
   "t1": 161.635,
   "text": "100,000.",
   "line": "L12",
   "spoken": "One hundred thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 161.655,
   "t1": 163.68,
   "text": "Nearly 4× wider.",
   "line": "L12",
   "spoken": "Nearly four times wider."
  },
  {
   "t0": 168.955,
   "t1": 173.45,
   "text": "Its shadow on Earth is wider, and eclipses come far more often.",
   "line": "L12",
   "spoken": "Its shadow on Earth is wider, and eclipses come far more often."
  },
  {
   "t0": 180.715,
   "t1": 183.98,
   "text": "Not every month, because the orbit is tilted.",
   "line": "L12",
   "spoken": "Not every month, because the orbit is tilted."
  },
  {
   "t0": 189.09,
   "t1": 190.17,
   "text": "But often.",
   "line": "L12",
   "spoken": "But often."
  },
  {
   "t0": 197.8,
   "t1": 200.97,
   "text": "If that made the sky feel bigger, tap like and subscribe.",
   "line": "D2",
   "spoken": "If that made the sky feel bigger, tap like and subscribe."
  },
  {
   "t0": 201.775,
   "t1": 202.905,
   "text": "Closer.",
   "line": "L13",
   "spoken": "Closer."
  },
  {
   "t0": 202.925,
   "t1": 203.99,
   "text": "Faster.",
   "line": "L13",
   "spoken": "Faster."
  },
  {
   "t0": 208.32,
   "t1": 210.61,
   "text": "And the ground feels it too.",
   "line": "L13",
   "spoken": "And the ground feels it too."
  },
  {
   "t0": 218.675,
   "t1": 220.505,
   "text": "70,000.",
   "line": "L14",
   "spoken": "Seventy thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 225.805,
   "t1": 228.975,
   "text": "More than 160× today's tidal pull.",
   "line": "L14",
   "spoken": "More than a hundred sixty times today's tidal pull."
  },
  {
   "t0": 236.19,
   "t1": 239.61,
   "text": "The solid ground already rises and falls tens of centimeters a day.",
   "line": "L14",
   "spoken": "The solid ground already rises and falls tens of centimeters a day."
  },
  {
   "t0": 248.385,
   "t1": 251.91,
   "text": "Here, it would flex far more.",
   "line": "L14",
   "spoken": "Here, it would flex far more."
  },
  {
   "t0": 260.45,
   "t1": 264.765,
   "text": "Soon, the Moon rises on the wrong side of the sky.",
   "line": "L15",
   "spoken": "Soon, the Moon rises on the wrong side of the sky."
  },
  {
   "t0": 272.53,
   "t1": 273.8,
   "text": "50,000.",
   "line": "L16",
   "spoken": "Fifty thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 273.82,
   "t1": 275.53,
   "text": "Nearly 8× wider.",
   "line": "L16",
   "spoken": "Nearly eight times wider."
  },
  {
   "t0": 279.89,
   "t1": 284.98,
   "text": "One lap takes about a day and a quarter, close to how fast the Earth turns.",
   "line": "L16",
   "spoken": "One lap takes about a day and a quarter, close to how fast the Earth turns."
  },
  {
   "t0": 289.57,
   "t1": 291.025,
   "text": "42,000.",
   "line": "L17",
   "spoken": "Forty-two thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 291.045,
   "t1": 293.06,
   "text": "It hangs still.",
   "line": "L17",
   "spoken": "It hangs still."
  },
  {
   "t0": 299.115,
   "t1": 300.725,
   "text": "Then it slides the wrong way.",
   "line": "L18",
   "spoken": "Then it slides the wrong way."
  },
  {
   "t0": 309.97,
   "t1": 311.83,
   "text": "It rises in the west.",
   "line": "L18",
   "spoken": "It rises in the west."
  },
  {
   "t0": 325.48,
   "t1": 326.48,
   "text": "30,000.",
   "line": "L19",
   "spoken": "Thirty thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 326.5,
   "t1": 326.9,
   "text": "25.",
   "line": "L19",
   "spoken": "Twenty-five."
  },
  {
   "t0": 326.92,
   "t1": 327.43,
   "text": "20.",
   "line": "L19",
   "spoken": "Twenty."
  },
  {
   "t0": 338.045,
   "t1": 342.915,
   "text": "Around 18,000 km is the Roche limit: where Earth's tides",
   "line": "L20",
   "spoken": "Around eighteen thousand kilometers is the Roche limit: where Earth's tides pull harder than the Moon's own gravity holds it together."
  },
  {
   "t0": 342.935,
   "t1": 346.45,
   "text": "pull harder than the Moon's own gravity holds it together.",
   "line": "L20",
   "spoken": "Around eighteen thousand kilometers is the Roche limit: where Earth's tides pull harder than the Moon's own gravity holds it together."
  },
  {
   "t0": 346.47,
   "t1": 348.07,
   "text": "That's if the Moon acts like a fluid.",
   "line": "L20",
   "spoken": "That's if the Moon acts like a fluid."
  },
  {
   "t0": 348.09,
   "t1": 351.525,
   "text": "A perfectly rigid Moon could come to about 9,500.",
   "line": "L20",
   "spoken": "A perfectly rigid Moon could come to about nine and a half thousand."
  },
  {
   "t0": 356.81,
   "t1": 361.27,
   "text": "At 18,000, it's more than 20× wider than tonight.",
   "line": "L21",
   "spoken": "At eighteen thousand, it's more than twenty times wider than tonight."
  },
  {
   "t0": 361.29,
   "t1": 363.333,
   "text": "A wall of grey, straining.",
   "line": "L21",
   "spoken": "A wall of grey, straining."
  },
  {
   "t0": 370.738,
   "t1": 373.188,
   "text": "And then it does something no Moon should survive.",
   "line": "L22",
   "spoken": "And then it does something no Moon should survive."
  },
  {
   "t0": 373.713,
   "t1": 374.858,
   "text": "It comes apart.",
   "line": "L23",
   "spoken": "It comes apart."
  },
  {
   "t0": 374.878,
   "t1": 376.158,
   "text": "Not an explosion.",
   "line": "L23",
   "spoken": "Not an explosion."
  },
  {
   "t0": 376.178,
   "t1": 377.368,
   "text": "A stretch.",
   "line": "L23",
   "spoken": "A stretch."
  },
  {
   "t0": 387.863,
   "t1": 393.308,
   "text": "The rock spreads along its old orbit, and over time it can flatten into a ring.",
   "line": "L24",
   "spoken": "The rock spreads along its old orbit, and over time it can flatten into a ring."
  },
  {
   "t0": 402.878,
   "t1": 403.683,
   "text": "No Moon.",
   "line": "L25",
   "spoken": "No Moon."
  },
  {
   "t0": 411.888,
   "t1": 415.498,
   "text": "Just a bright band, horizon to horizon.",
   "line": "L25",
   "spoken": "Just a bright band, horizon to horizon."
  },
  {
   "t0": 416.118,
   "t1": 420.378,
   "text": "The real Moon is still drifting away, 3.8 cm a year.",
   "line": "L26",
   "spoken": "The real Moon is still drifting away, three point eight centimeters a year."
  },
  {
   "t0": 420.398,
   "t1": 422.488,
   "text": "Tonight's Moon is fine.",
